</tr>
<tr style="height: 22px;">
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: left;">Once a week or more</td>
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: center;"><math alttext="3"><mn>3</mn>
</math></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22px;">
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: left;">Two or three times a month</td>
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: center;"><math alttext="16"><mn>16</mn>
</math></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22px;">
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: left;">About once a month</td>
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: center;"><math alttext="26"><mn>26</mn>
</math></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22px;">
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: left;">A few times a year</td>
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: center;"><math alttext="73"><mn>73</mn>
</math></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22px;">
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: left;">Almost never</td>
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: center;"><math alttext="53"><mn>53</mn>
</math></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22px;">
<td style="width: 47.704%; height: 22px; text-align: left;">Never</td>
