<p style="text-align: left;">Which of the following equations best represents the line of best fit shown?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"cdd3c139-53cf-42e8-aba0-4c394f1fb198","content":"<p><math alttext=\"y equals 2.8 plus 1.7 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>1.7</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"6119cda6-1f4e-4b3d-9e4c-5adc5f3255de","content":"<p><math alttext=\"y equals 2.8 minus 1.7 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>1.7</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"d9bc9702-f9ad-4274-a450-0a817467839d","content":"<p><math alttext=\"y equals negative 2.8 plus 1.7 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>1.7</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"a2a51b30-a908-4a72-8e0b-af01a38247d4","content":"<p><math alttext=\"y equals negative 2.8 minus 1.7 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>1.7</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["A"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["cdd3c139-53cf-42e8-aba0-4c394f1fb198"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is correct. The line of best fit shown intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at a positive <em>y</em>-value and has a positive slope. The graph of an equation of the form <math alttext="y equals a plus b x"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, where <math alttext="a"><mi>a</mi>
</math> and <math alttext="b"><mi>b</mi>
</math> are constants, intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at a <em>y</em>-value of <math alttext="a"><mi>a</mi>
</math> and has a slope of <math alttext="b"><mi>b</mi>
</math>. Of the given choices, only choice A represents a line that intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at a positive <em>y</em>-value, <math alttext="2.8"><mn>2.8</mn>
</math>, and has a positive slope, <math alttext="1.7"><mn>1.7</mn>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This equation represents a line that has a negative slope, not a positive slope.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This equation represents a line that intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at a negative <em>y</em>-value, not a positive <em>y</em>-value.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This equation represents a line that intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at a negative <em>y</em>-value, not a positive <em>y</em>-value, and has a negative slope, not a positive slope.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$manifold$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"d230e963","external_id":"234d1fe8-4e40-4728-ad3a-674eb0fb9188","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":"0b771073-e6d6-4c53-ad9a-e6319b238e57","uId":"42a460c9-c521-4415-b605-78882dcb898b","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"Q","domain":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","skill_cd":"Q.D.","skill_desc":"Two-variable data: Models and scatterplots","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":2,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The scatterplot shows the relationship between two variables, <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>. A line of best fit is also shown.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"275.22pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 286.56 275.22\" width=\"286.56pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A scatterplot in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from 0 to 8 in increments of 1. The y axis ranges from 0 to 16 in increments of 1, with values marked every 2 grid lines. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 275.22 \nL 286.56 275.22 \nL 286.56 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 260.46 \nL 279.36 260.46 \nL 279.36 10.98 \nL 7.2 10.98 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.a