d in miles per minute, or the number of miles the space station travels on average in 2 minutes. Choice C is incorrect. This is triple the space station&rsquo;s average speed in miles per minute, or the number of miles the space station travels on average in 3 minutes.&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":1,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959616,"pPcc":"SAT#Q","questionId":"d28c29e1","skill_cd":"Q.A.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Ratios, rates, proportional relationships, and units","createDate":1691007959616,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","ibn":"019681-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"Q","uId":"059e52e3-2472-4590-a4fa-a4bdcb3f550b","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"019681-DC","section":"Math","prompt":"<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">The International Space Station orbits Earth at an average speed of 4.76 miles per second. What is the space station&rsquo;s average speed in miles per <span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"formatted_text text_decoration:underline \">hour</span></span>?</p>\n","answer":{"style":"Multiple Choice","choices":{"a":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">285.6</p>\n"},"b":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">571.2</p>\n"},"c":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">856.8</p>\n"},"d":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">17,136.0</p>\n"}},"correct_choice":"d","rationale":"<p>Choice D is correct. Since 1 minute = 60 seconds and 1 hour = 60 minutes, it follows that 1 hour = (60)(60), or 3,600 seconds. Using this conversion factor, the space station&rsquo;s average speed of 4.76 miles per second is equal to an average speed of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"the fraction with numerator 4 point 7 6 miles, and denominator second, times, the fraction with numerator 3,600 seconds, and denominator hour, equals, the fraction with numerator 17,136 miles, and denominator hour\"></span>, or 17,136 miles per hour.<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the space station&rsquo;s average speed in miles per minute. Choice B is incorrect. This is double the space station&rsquo;s average speed in miles per minute, or the number of miles the space station travels on average in 2 minutes. Choice C is incorrect. This is triple the space station&rsquo;s average speed in miles per minute, or the number of miles the space station travels on average in 3 minutes.&nbsp;</p></p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959616,"updateDate":1691007959616}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959616, 1691007959616),
