<li>From left to right the values of the vertical bars in the Group 1 box plot are as follows:
<ul>
<li>First vertical bar: 21</li>
<li>Second vertical bar: 22</li>
<li>Third vertical bar: 25</li>
<li>Fourth vertical bar: 26</li>
