    ($SATQ$e5b5fbdd$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$020456-DC$SATQ$, $SATQ$disclosed$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.E.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Probability and conditional probability$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p class="stem_paragraph ">Of the 8 planets in our solar system, 4 are considered rocky. If a student randomly selects 1 of those 8 planets as a topic for a report, what is the probability that the selected planet will be rocky?</p>
