probability if 1 of the 8 planets was considered rocky (choice A) and if 2 of the 8 planets were considered rocky (choice B). Choice D is incorrect and may result from dividing the total number of planets by the number of planets that are considered rocky.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
